      "text": "CORE PROBLEMS:\n  Population:   Why do numbers change? What limits growth?\n  Community:    Which species coexist? What determines biodiversity?\n  Ecosystem:    How does energy flow? How do nutrients cycle?\n  Biosphere:    What are the planetary consequences of living systems?"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ECOLOGY.md#007",
      "path": [
        "05-ECOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:biology:05-ecology, git-history:biology:05-ecology]",
