        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - Ecology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TWO CURRENCIES OF ECOLOGY:\n  Energy: flows through ecosystems (enters via photosynthesis, lost as heat)\n  Nutrients: cycle within ecosystems (recycled by decomposers)\n  → Energy is a one-way flow; matter cycles"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ECOLOGY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "05-ECOLOGY.md"
      ],
