        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - Ecology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ECOLOGY ↔ EVOLUTION FEEDBACK:\n  Ecology sets selection pressures (who survives, who reproduces)\n  Evolution changes organisms (traits, life histories)\n  Eco-evolutionary dynamics: evolution can happen fast enough to affect ecology\n  Example: rapid evolution of prey defense when predator introduced\n```"
    },
