      "text": "```\nDEMOGRAPHIC EQUATION:\n  ΔN = B − D + I − E   (Births − Deaths + Immigration − Emigration)\n  In closed population: dN/dt = (b − d)N = rN"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ECOLOGY.md#019",
      "path": [
