        "title": "05 - Ecology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXPONENTIAL GROWTH:\n  dN/dt = rN,   N(t) = N₀eʳᵗ\n  r = intrinsic rate of increase (b − d)\n  J-shaped curve; requires unlimited resources\n  Human population: ~1% per year currently; was ~2% peak 1960s"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-ECOLOGY.md#020",
      "path": [
        "05-ECOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
