        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - Ecology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LOGISTIC GROWTH:\n  dN/dt = rN · (K − N)/K\n  K = carrying capacity (resources set ceiling)\n  Inflection at N = K/2 (maximum growth rate)\n  S-shaped curve: fast growth → decelerate → plateau at K"
    }
